# ==============================================================================
# ATLAS Travel Club Investor Portal - Outbound Email Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# Configure this file (.env.local) to enable real-time delivery of 6-digit
# verification access codes to investor emails via Gmail SMTP or custom SMTP.
#
# For Gmail / Google Workspace:
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification on your Google Account (myaccount.google.com/security)
# 2. Go to "App Passwords" (myaccount.google.com/apppasswords)
# 3. Create a new App Password named "ATLAS Investor Portal" (generates 16 characters)
# 4. Fill in the values below (remove quotes or keep them):

SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_USER=executive@atlastravelclub.com
SMTP_PASS=your_16_char_app_password
SMTP_FROM="ATLAS Investor Relations" <executive@atlastravelclub.com>

# If SMTP_USER and SMTP_PASS are omitted, the system generates secure OTP codes,
# logs them to data/verification_emails_sent.log, and allows local verification.
